# SamChe Platform Backend & Dashboard

The canonical SamChe Strict Execution / Non-Regression Contract is in the
repository-root `AGENTS.md`. Read and follow it before inspecting or changing
the repository. Do not duplicate that contract here.

Repository-specific context:

- Default working branch for current development is `staging`.
- Reuse existing engineering guidance instead of rediscovering architecture.

Reference these existing sources when relevant. Read only the specific
guidance needed for the requested task; do not automatically read all of it:

- `.agent/budget-policy.md`
- `.agent/prompts/`
- `docs/engineering/`

Cost-control reminders:

- Minimize Vertex token usage.
- Prefer targeted file reads.
- Avoid `node_modules` and generated files.
- Keep reports concise.
- Stop once acceptance criteria are met.
